      "message": "fix(post): place the setup-change stop per mount, not per machine (#1532)\n\nTwo setups on one machine but different posts are two files: the\nlast op of each file gets no setup-change stop. The stops follow the\nmounts the reading post groups (an explicit script posts every post's\nsetups of a machine in one file, so it still stops there). Tormach's\ntrip-home refusal names the operation.\n\nRefs #1532\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
